msgid ""
"Tattu Plus batteries with AS150U connectors support DroneCAN which allows "
"the autopilot to retrieve the battery's total voltage, individual cell "
"voltages, current, temperature and percentage of remaining capacity."
msgstr ""
"带 AS150U 连接器的 Tattu Plus 电池支持 DroneCAN，允许飞控获取电池的总电压、单节电压、电流、温度和剩余容量百分比。"

