"To more easily see the average voltage and total current of multiple "
"batteries a :ref:`\"Sum of Selected Monitors\" battery monitor <common-"
"power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner>` can be configured."
msgstr ""
"若要更方便地查看多个电池的平均电压和总电流，可配置 :ref:`「所选监测器之和」电池监测器 <common-power-module-"
"configuration-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:49
