msgid ""
"Once connected the battery voltage, current, percent remaining, etc will be "
"visible in the ground station and recorded in the onboard logs.  The image "
"below shows where the data appears on Mission Planner's status screen."
msgstr ""
"连接后，电池电压、电流、剩余百分比等信息将显示在地面站并记录到板载日志中。下图显示了数据在 Mission Planner 状态界面中的显示位置。"
